{"id":"653927","name":"玉米西兰花黑虎虾沙拉","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/653927/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黑虎虾","amount":"2只"},{"name":"西兰花","amount":"200g"},{"name":"熟玉米粒","amount":"2把"}],"sub":[{"name":"洋葱","amount":"些许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"特新鲜的黑虎虾。","img":"images/653927/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"处理干净。","img":"images/653927/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"取西兰花，分成小块洗净。","img":"images/653927/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"取玉米粒。","img":"images/653927/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把西兰花菜梗跟玉米黑虎虾一起下锅。","img":"images/653927/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煮开锅5分钟。","img":"images/653927/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放西兰花煮熟。","img":"images/653927/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"虾摆盘。","img":"images/653927/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"掰一些处理干净的洋葱。","img":"images/653927/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"洋葱跟玉米西兰花放一起。","img":"images/653927/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放食盐为了瘦身，正常饮食人群可以放沙拉酱。","img":"images/653927/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/653927/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/653927/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/653927/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}